Subject: Cantor Phase3 Inventory Consistency Evidence Revision

Description: Canonical SJS authority for one coordinated zero-effect schema repair across Phase3 machine forms and topology receipt forms. It replaces state-inflating consistency vocabulary with explicit inventory-consistency evidence vocabulary, strictly rejects legacy representations, reserves but does not admit snapshot evidence, and issues two separately scoped replacement signatures that must activate together. It grants no physical acquisition, scanner, snapshot primitive, receipt issuance, consumption, admission, mutation, or effect authority.

