& [EffectContract] is zero
  + deterministic supplied-value serde, closed enum validation, exact comparisons, bounded diagnostics, and tests only
  + no unsafe, windows-sys call, Windows API, filesystem, handle, pointer, process, environment, clock, randomness, network, persistence, database, Git runtime, model, tool, physical fixture, acquisition, receipt issuance, admission, mutation, seal, cleanup, or promotion
  + no dependency, feature, lockfile, platform-call, unsafe-count, or effect delta

