& [JointActivationGate] is satisfied only by both signatures
  + both signature UUIDs occur in this exact canonical artifact
  + both signatures bind the exact same source, exploded specification, phase lock, registry, and processed stage set
  + each signature names its own predecessor and implementation scope
  + implementation must preserve compile coherence across both modules in one governed milestone
  + invalidation of either signature invalidates joint implementation authority before trust
  + [implementation_authority] is exact pure two-module revision and bounded support only
